 milestone for TRIMSON!We've been testing TRIMSON on real Steam Deck hardware, including gameplay, performance, controller support, menus, and overall playability.Seeing TRIMSON running on a handheld after years of solo development is an incredible feeling, and testing will continue as we work toward the full release.The TRIMSON Demo is available now on Steam, so you can jump into the infected zones and experience the game for yourself.Thank you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T01:39:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4589190-1844751498221741","game_id":"steam-4589190","kind":"update","title":"TRIMSON Major Update – New Features & Improvements","summary":"TRIMSON Major UpdateA major update has arrived for TRIMSON! This update brings new features, gameplay improvements, expanded settings, better controller support, performance improvements, and numerous fixes throughout the game.🏠 Housing SystemPlayers can now purchase their own home in TRIMSON and upgrade it over time, giving you a permanent place of your own within the world.🎮 Controls & Accessibility• Added mouse sensitivity settings • Added invert Y-axis option • Improved controller support an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T14:32:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221741","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4589190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:55:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:55:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4589190":"2026-10-26T02:55:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4589190":{"